/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
   §G 行动选项 .pga — AI 输出 <div class="pga"> 包 5 个 ```数字 代码块
   平台对「纯数字 language tag 顶层 code fence」自动注入点击/复制 UI。
   造型: 执行指令按钮卡片 · 墨全框 + 顶部藏青线 · 序号=右下角描红幽灵水印(CSS counter)
   ⚠️ 无任何左侧竖条 · 行动文字是绝对主角 · 右上「执行」角标
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.markdown-body .pga{
  display:flex!important;
  flex-direction:column!important;
  gap:10px!important;
  margin:1.5em 0!important;
  padding:0!important;
  background:transparent!important;
  border:none!important;
  counter-reset:opt!important
}
.markdown-body .pga pre{
  counter-increment:opt!important;
  margin:0!important;
  padding:0.85em 2.7em 0.85em 1.1em!important;
  background:#fbfaf7!important;
  border:1px solid #222a2c!important;
  border-top:3px solid #2b4260!important;
  border-radius:0!important;
  box-shadow:2px 2px 0 rgba(34,42,44,0.12)!important;
  position:relative!important;
  overflow:hidden!important;
  cursor:pointer!important;
  line-height:1.62!important;
  transition:border-color 0.15s ease,box-shadow 0.12s ease,transform 0.12s ease!important
}
.markdown-body .pga pre::before{
  content:counter(opt)!important;
  position:absolute!important;
  right:0.16em!important;
  bottom:-0.24em!important;
  z-index:0!important;
  font-family:Georgia,'Noto Serif SC',serif!important;
  font-size:2.8em!important;
  font-weight:900!important;
  font-style:italic!important;
  color:rgba(169,133,46,0.14)!important;
  pointer-events:none!important;
  transition:color 0.15s ease!important
}
.markdown-body .pga pre::after{
  content:'执行'!important;
  position:absolute!important;
  right:-1px!important;top:-1px!important;
  z-index:1!important;
  background:#a9852e!important;
  color:#f1efe9!important;
  font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif!important;
  font-size:0.56em!important;
  font-weight:900!important;
  letter-spacing:0.1em!important;
  padding:2px 6px!important;
  opacity:0.85!important;
  transition:opacity 0.15s ease!important
}
.markdown-body .pga pre:hover{
  border-color:#a9852e!important;
  box-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(169,133,46,0.22)!important;
  transform:translate(-1px,-1px)!important
}
