     纸底 #f1efe9→#17140e  paper2 #dfdbd0→#211d15  paper3 #c9cdd4→#2a251c  卡 #fbfaf7→#1d1a12
     墨 #222a2c→#ddd7c6  墨软 #353f42→#b6af9d  次 #6a7176→#8f8878  弱 #8b8f8c→#757067
     鎏金 #a9852e→#d4a94a  金深 #8a6c22→#c99a3a  金晕 rgba(212,169,74,.14)
